# Canonical author identities.
#
# One person committed under five name/email pairs across three addresses, so
# `git shortlog -sn`, `git log --author=`, and every contribution graph split the
# same author into five. This file collapses them; it changes reporting only, not
# the commits themselves.
#
# Format: <canonical name> <canonical email> <name as committed> <email as committed>
# The canonical pair matches the repository's configured user.name/user.email.

Pablo Jimenez Mateo <pablojimenezmateo@gmail.com> <gef3233@gmail.com>
